    <string name="instructions_title">Instructions</string>
    <string name="instruction_1">1. Make sure Shizuku is running and authorized (or select \"%1$s\")</string>
    <string name="instruction_2">2. Take a screenshot on the bill page in Alipay / WeChat / UnionPay / Taobao / JD / Douyin (Shizuku mode: tap the floating button or Quick Settings tile)</string>
    <string name="instruction_3">3. It will automatically recognize amount, discount, original amount, merchant, payment method and order number</string>
    <string name="instruction_4">4. Confirm the information and save the accounting record</string>
    <string name="principle_title">How It Works</string>
    <string name="principle_expand">Expand</string>
    <string name="principle_collapse">Collapse</string>
    <string name="principle_point_1">1. Fully offline: recognition and translation happen on your phone — nothing is uploaded and no network is needed.</string>
    <string name="principle_point_2">2. Text recognition (OCR): uses the PP-OCRv6 model to read text from your screenshot (ONNX Runtime + OpenCV).</string>
    <string name="principle_point_3">3. Semantic extraction: a local LLM (Qwen3-0.6B, Google LiteRT-LM) understands the text and outputs fields such as amount, discount, original amount, merchant, time, payment method and order number.</string>
    <string name="principle_point_4">4. It suggests the bill category based on the merchant and receipt content.</string>
    <string name="principle_point_5">5. Offline translation: Chinese-English translation of category names uses the OPUS-MT (Marian) AI model on your device.</string>
    <string name="principle_point_6">6. Customizable: edit the prompt in "Recognition Settings", or use "remember this correction" to improve recognition without reinstalling.</string>
